{"schema":"literary-friend.reference-page.v1","originalPath":"assets/fontforge-reference/doc/sphinx/olddocs/old/ja/tilepath.html","title":"パスのタイル敷き","sourceSha256":"0bc09050548831abd8661c153054e0fa317db0780e919146c63d8a3bed3e013c","headingIndex":[{"level":1,"text":"パスのタイル敷き"}],"scripts":[],"styles":[],"documentTree":[{"tag":"html","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"head","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":" Created with AOLpress/2.0 "},"\n",{"comment":" AP: Created on: 4-Sep-2002 "},"\n",{"comment":" AP: Last modified: 13-Oct-2004 "},"\n",{"tag":"meta","attributes":{"http-equiv":"Content-Type","content":"text/html; charset=utf-8"},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"<TITLE>Tile Path</TITLE>"},"\n",{"tag":"title","attributes":{},"children":["パスのタイル敷き"]},"\n",{"tag":"link","attributes":{"rel":"icon","href":"../../_static/fftype16.png"},"children":[]},"\n",{"tag":"link","attributes":{"rel":"stylesheet","type":"text/css","href":"FontForge.css"},"children":[]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"body","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"div","attributes":{"id":"in"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"h1","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"comment":"Tile Path"},"\n    パスのタイル敷き\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\nThe Tile Path command may be used to apply a repetative decoration to a font.\nA decoration is copied into the selection (this is the \"tile\") and the command\nis invoked on a glyph. All paths in that glyph will be replaced by the tile\nfit to the curve. "},"\n",{"tag":"code","attributes":{},"children":["パスのタイル敷き(",{"tag":"u","attributes":{},"children":["P"]},")..."]}," コマンドは、フォントに繰り返し模様の装飾を施すのに用いることができます。あらかじめ装飾模様を選択しておき (これを敷きつめる“タイル”として用います)、対象となるグリフ上でコマンドを起動します。そのグリフに含まれるすべてのパスは、タイルを曲線に沿わせたもので置き換えられます。\n"]},{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\nConsider the following: "},"\n以下の例を考えてみましょう:\n"]},{"tag":"table","attributes":{"border":"","cellpadding":"2"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-selection.png","width":"64","height":"220"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  The tile</TD>"},"\n      タイル"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-orig.png","width":"188","height":"220"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  Two paths to be tiled.</TD>"},"\n      タイルが敷きつめられる 2 本のパス"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-final.png","width":"188","height":"220"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  The result.</TD>"},"\n      結果。"]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\nThe tile has been replicated (and warped) to follow the original contours. "},"\nタイルはオリジナルの輪郭に沿って複製され (かつ撓ませられ) ます。\n"]},{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/TilePath.png","width":"303","height":"148"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"\nThe Tile Path dialog gives you a few choices to control how the tile is placed.\nThe tile can be either centered on the path, or be tangent to the left edge\nof the path (for a clockwise path, the left edge is outside the path), or\nbe tangent to the right edge (for a clockwise path the right edge is inside\nthe path). "},"\n",{"tag":"code","attributes":{},"children":["パスのタイル敷き"]}," ダイアログでは、どのようにタイルを敷くかに関して 2, 3 の選択を行うことができます。タイルはパスに中心揃えするか、またはパスの左端に接して並べるか (時計回りのパスの場合、左端はパスの外側になります)、またはパスの右端に接して並べるか (時計回りのパスの場合、右端はパスの内側になります) が選べます。\n"]},{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\nYou can also chose whether you want the tile to be tiled without scaling\n(in which case you will probably be left with a fraction of the tile at one\nend), tiled with scaling (the tile will be scaled so that it fits on the\npath an integral number of times), or simply scaled (in which case there\nwill be exactly one tile and it will be scaled to be as long as the path. "},"\nまた、タイルを拡大/縮小しないで貼りつけるか (この場合おそらく、片方の端にタイルの断片が残ることになるでしょう)、拡大/縮小を伴った貼りつけを行うか (タイルはパスの整数倍にちょうど合うように拡大/縮小されます)、または単純に拡大/縮小するか (この場合、敷きつめられるのはちょうどタイル 1 個になり、タイルはパスの長さと一致するように拡大/縮小されます) が選択できます。\n"]},{"tag":"table","attributes":{"border":"","cellpadding":"2"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-left.png","width":"153","height":"244"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  left (outside)</TD>"},"\n      左側 (外側)"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-center.png","width":"153","height":"244"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  center</TD> "},"\n      中央"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-right.png","width":"153","height":"244"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  right (inside)</TD>"},"\n      右側 (内側)"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-tile.png","width":"77","height":"220"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  tile</TD>"},"\n      タイル貼り\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-ts.png","width":"70","height":"220"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  tile &amp; scale</TD>"},"\n      タイル貼りおよび拡大/縮小\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/tilepath-scale.png","width":"74","height":"220"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  scale</TD> "},"\n      拡大/縮小\n  "]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n"]},{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n— ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"elementmenu.page.json","hrefOriginal":"elementmenu.html"},"children":["前"]}," — ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"overview.page.json","hrefOriginal":"overview.html"},"children":["目次"]},"\n— ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"elementmenu.page.json","hrefOriginal":"elementmenu.html"},"children":["次"]}," —\n"]},{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n"]}]},"\n"]}]},"\n"]}